  "job_A3.22.12_20260920_210246": {
    "chunk_text": "Fotum ic fere, foldan slite, grene wongas, \u00feenden ic g\u00e6st bere. Gif me feorh losa\u00f0, f\u00e6ste binde swearte Wealas, hwilum sellan men. Hwilum ic deorum drincan selle beorne of bosme, hwilum mec bryd triede\u00f0 felawlonc fotum, hwilum Saga hw\u00e6t ic hatte, \u00fee ic lifgende lond reafige ond \u00e6fter dea\u00fee dryhtum \u00feeowige..",
